.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--codex-_RUN-260810-ee8981.log:9700:- FINDING: SwiftNIO SSH hardcodes each child receive-window target to 16 MiB and exposes client `_rekey()` only internally. libssh2 exposes generic per-channel initial/remaining/adjust APIs, but its direct-tcpip helper fixes the 2 MiB default and it likewise has no public client-rekey API or automatic byte/time threshold.
