    75	## Adapter and configuration boundary
    76	
    77	`ReluxTunnelCore` owns candidate-neutral transport/session/channel contracts.
    78	Only `ReluxTunnelLibSSH2Adapter` imports the public XCFramework module. The
    79	selected adapter is composed only in the approved macOS provider and harness;
    80	the shared core and deferred iOS graph contain no libssh2 type. One serialized
    81	owner services each mutable libssh2 session and its socket, channels, KEX,
    82	timers, callback bridge, allocation accounting, and teardown.
